  "reading": "まどわす",
  "romaji": "madowasu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to mislead; to confuse; to lead astray",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to mislead; to confuse; to lead astray",
      "explanation": "To cause someone to lose clear judgment through deception, temptation, or distraction. The transitive counterpart of {惑|まど}う (to be perplexed)."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "28047_madowasu_ex1",
      "japanese": "{人|ひと}を{惑|まど}わす。",
      "english": "To mislead people.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28047_madowasu_ex2",
      "japanese": "うわさが{世間|せけん}を{惑|まど}わした。",
      "english": "The rumor confused the public.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28047_madowasu_ex3",
      "japanese": "{誇大|こだい}な{広告|こうこく}は{消費者|しょうひしゃ}を{惑|まど}わすことがある。",
      "english": "Exaggerated advertising can mislead consumers.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Transitive godan verb. Xを{惑|まど}わす.\n\nImplies leading someone away from sound judgment, whether by rumor, temptation, or deliberate deception.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {心|こころ}を{惑|まど}わす: to unsettle/disturb the heart\n- {人|ひと}の{目|め}を{惑|まど}わす: to deceive the eye\n- {判断|はんだん}を{惑|まど}わす: to cloud one's judgment\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- だます: to deceive — emphasizes outright lying\n- {迷|まよ}わせる: to make someone hesitate or lose their way",
